{
  "apiVersion": "dashboard.grafana.app/v2",
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "bug-bash-overview"
  },
  "spec": {
    "annotations": [
      {
        "kind": "AnnotationQuery",
        "spec": {
          "builtIn": true,
          "enable": true,
          "hide": true,
          "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
          "name": "Annotations \u0026 Alerts",
          "query": {
            "datasource": {
              "name": "-- Grafana --"
            },
            "group": "grafana",
            "kind": "DataQuery",
            "spec": {},
            "version": "v0"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "cursorSync": "Off",
    "description": "Overview dashboard for the Azure Managed Grafana team bug bash session using Grafana 13 Git Sync.",
    "editable": true,
    "elements": {
      "panel-1": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "queryOptions": {},
              "transformations": []
            }
          },
          "description": "",
          "id": 1,
          "links": [],
          "title": "Bug Bash Instructions",
          "vizConfig": {
            "group": "text",
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "spec": {
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              },
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "# Azure Managed Grafana – Git Sync Bug Bash\n\nWelcome to the bug bash for Grafana 13 Git Sync! This dashboard is managed via Git Sync and lives in a GitHub repository.\n\n## What to Test\n\n- **Bi-directional sync**: Ediin GitHub.\n- **Pull request previews**: Mthe dashboard is updated automatically.\n- **Edit from GitHub**: Modify a dashbears in Grafana.\n- **Folder sync**: Create/renaitHub.\n- **Conflict resolution**: Make simultandled.\n\n## Repo Structure\n\n```\ngrafana/\n  bug-bash-overview.json          ← this dashboard (root level)\n  AzureManagedGrafana/\n    team-dashboard.json           ← team-specific dashboard\n    metrics-overview.json         ← metrics overview\n```\n\n## Useful Links\n\n- [Git Sync Documentation](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/observability-as-code/provision-resources/git-sync-setup/)\n- [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/Jeralan/gitsynctest)\n",
                "mode": "markdown"
              }
            },
            "version": "13.0.0-local"
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-2": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "queryOptions": {},
              "transformations": []
            }
          },
          "description": "",
          "id": 2,
          "links": [],
          "title": "Quick Test Tip",
          "vizConfig": {
            "group": "text",
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "spec": {
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              },
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "**Edit this dashboard from the Grafana UI or directly in GitHub to test Git Sync!**\n\nSave changes in Grafana → push to a branch → open a PR → merge → see the update reflected.",
                "mode": "markdown"
              }
            },
            "version": "13.0.0-local"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "layout": {
      "kind": "GridLayout",
      "spec": {
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "GridLayoutItem",
            "spec": {
              "element": {
                "kind": "ElementReference",
                "name": "panel-1"
              },
              "height": 10,
              "width": 24,
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0
            }
          },
          {
            "kind": "GridLayoutItem",
            "spec": {
              "element": {
                "kind": "ElementReference",
                "name": "panel-2"
              },
              "height": 4,
              "width": 24,
              "x": 0,
              "y": 10
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "links": [
      {
        "asDropdown": false,
        "icon": "external link",
        "includeVars": false,
        "keepTime": false,
        "tags": [],
        "targetBlank": true,
        "title": "Source (GitHub)",
        "tooltip": "View source file in repository",
        "type": "link",
        "url": "https://github.com/Jeralan/gitsynctest/blob/main/grafana/bug-bash-overview.json"
      }
    ],
    "liveNow": false,
    "preload": false,
